{"text":{"en":{"MHL형 오일 게이지 | [회사명] 베어링":"MHL Type Oil Gage | [Company Name] Bearing","<p class=\"eyebrow\">MHL Type Oil Gage</p> <h2>MHL형 오일 게이지</h2> <p>MHL형 오일게이지는 설치보드 셋트부분의 파손이나 강하수치를 사용하여 내충격에 강함으로 파손에 안심할 수 있으며, 빨간 눈금으로 낮고 오일량 부분의 뒷면이 백색의 반사판이 있어 오일량 확인은 웰른 오일의 세세한 변화까지 확인됩니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">MHL Type Oil Gage</p> <h2>MHL Type Oil Gage</h2> <p>The MHL type oil gage has an impact-resistant structure at the mounting board set section, reducing the risk of breakage, and a white reflector plate behind the red-graduated oil level area lets you clearly check even the smallest changes in oil level.</p>","단위: mm · A~D=본체 각부 치수 · E=체결 나사 규격":"Unit: mm · A–D = main body dimensions · E = mounting screw spec","<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">설치 방법</strong><br> 치수의 피치에 맞추어 E치수의 나사구멍을 열어 주십시오. 사용자를 위로하여 상하의 보드를 단단하게 평강으로 조여 주시면 견고하게 설치됩니다. 보통의 힘으로 설치하시고, 그 이상 단단하게 조일 필요는 없습니다.":"<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">Installation Method</strong><br> Drill the screw hole for dimension E to match the hole pitch. Clamp the upper and lower boards firmly and evenly using flat bars for a secure installation. Install using normal force only — there is no need to tighten it any harder than that.","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">형태 참고용 개념도 (SWS 카탈로그 실측 도면·제조사 도면 아님) — 볼트 2개로 체결하는 세로형(롱 타입) 오일 게이지의 일반적인 구성</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 380 230\" width=\"360\" height=\"218\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <rect x=\"70\" y=\"14\" width=\"44\" height=\"184\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <rect x=\"81\" y=\"44\" width=\"22\" height=\"124\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e3eef8\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <line x1=\"81\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"103\" y2=\"106\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"28\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"184\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <text x=\"92\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">정면</text> <rect x=\"200\" y=\"14\" width=\"24\" height=\"184\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <rect x=\"224\" y=\"22\" width=\"34\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#eeeeee\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <rect x=\"224\" y=\"178\" width=\"34\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#eeeeee\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <g stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"232\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"229\" y2=\"34\"><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"237\" y2=\"34\"><line x1=\"248\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"245\" y2=\"34\"><line x1=\"256\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"253\" y2=\"34\"> <line x1=\"232\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"229\" y2=\"190\"><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"237\" y2=\"190\"><line x1=\"248\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"245\" y2=\"190\"><line x1=\"256\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"253\" y2=\"190\"> </g> <text x=\"212\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">측면</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"103\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"70\"> <line x1=\"103\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"112\"> <line x1=\"258\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"282\" y2=\"50\"> <line x1=\"258\" y1=\"184\" x2=\"282\" y2=\"160\"> </g> <text x=\"134\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">투명 창</text> <text x=\"134\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">빨간 눈금</text> <text x=\"286\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">체결 볼트</text> <text x=\"286\" y=\"75\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">(E = 나사 규격)</text> <text x=\"286\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">체결 볼트</text> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">표의 E = 체결 나사 규격(표 하단 각주 기준)입니다. A~D는 본체 각부 치수이나, 원본 규격표에서 각 문자가 어느 부위를 재는지(볼트 피치·전장 등) 확인되지 않아 개념도에 표시하지 않았습니다 — 측정 위치가 필요하면 문의해 주세요. 창 뒷면에는 백색 반사판이 있으며, 비례는 실제와 다를 수 있습니다.</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Conceptual diagram for shape reference only (not an SWS catalog measured drawing or manufacturer drawing) — typical layout of a vertical (long-type) oil gauge fastened with two bolts</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 380 230\" width=\"360\" height=\"218\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <rect x=\"70\" y=\"14\" width=\"44\" height=\"184\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <rect x=\"81\" y=\"44\" width=\"22\" height=\"124\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e3eef8\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <line x1=\"81\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"103\" y2=\"106\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"28\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"184\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <text x=\"92\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">Front</text> <rect x=\"200\" y=\"14\" width=\"24\" height=\"184\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <rect x=\"224\" y=\"22\" width=\"34\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#eeeeee\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <rect x=\"224\" y=\"178\" width=\"34\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#eeeeee\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <g stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"232\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"229\" y2=\"34\"><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"237\" y2=\"34\"><line x1=\"248\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"245\" y2=\"34\"><line x1=\"256\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"253\" y2=\"34\"> <line x1=\"232\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"229\" y2=\"190\"><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"237\" y2=\"190\"><line x1=\"248\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"245\" y2=\"190\"><line x1=\"256\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"253\" y2=\"190\"> </g> <text x=\"212\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">Side</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"103\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"70\"> <line x1=\"103\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"112\"> <line x1=\"258\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"282\" y2=\"50\"> <line x1=\"258\" y1=\"184\" x2=\"282\" y2=\"160\"> </g> <text x=\"134\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Clear window</text> <text x=\"134\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Red level mark</text> <text x=\"286\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Mounting bolt</text> <text x=\"286\" y=\"75\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">(E = thread size)</text> <text x=\"286\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Mounting bolt</text> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">E in the table = mounting thread size (per the footnote below the table). A–D are dimensions of parts of the body, but the original table does not confirm which part each letter measures (bolt pitch, overall length, etc.), so they are not marked on the diagram — please contact us if you need the measurement positions. There is a white reflector behind the window, and proportions may differ from the actual product.</p>"},"ja":{"MHL형 오일 게이지 | [회사명] 베어링":"MHL形オイルゲージ | [会社名] ベアリング","<p class=\"eyebrow\">MHL Type Oil Gage</p> <h2>MHL형 오일 게이지</h2> <p>MHL형 오일게이지는 설치보드 셋트부분의 파손이나 강하수치를 사용하여 내충격에 강함으로 파손에 안심할 수 있으며, 빨간 눈금으로 낮고 오일량 부분의 뒷면이 백색의 반사판이 있어 오일량 확인은 웰른 오일의 세세한 변화까지 확인됩니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">MHL Type Oil Gage</p> <h2>MHL形オイルゲージ</h2> <p>MHL形オイルゲージは、取付ボードのセット部分の破損に強い耐衝撃構造となっており破損の心配が少なく、赤色目盛りの油量部分の裏面に白色の反射板があるため、油量のわずかな変化まで確認できます。</p>","단위: mm · A~D=본체 각부 치수 · E=체결 나사 규격":"単位: mm ・ A~D=本体各部寸法 ・ E=締結ねじ規格","<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">설치 방법</strong><br> 치수의 피치에 맞추어 E치수의 나사구멍을 열어 주십시오. 사용자를 위로하여 상하의 보드를 단단하게 평강으로 조여 주시면 견고하게 설치됩니다. 보통의 힘으로 설치하시고, 그 이상 단단하게 조일 필요는 없습니다.":"<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">取付方法</strong><br> 寸法のピッチに合わせてE寸法のねじ穴を開けてください。上下のボードを平鋼でしっかりと均等に締め付けると、堅固に取り付けられます。通常の力で取り付けてください。それ以上強く締め付ける必要はありません。","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">형태 참고용 개념도 (SWS 카탈로그 실측 도면·제조사 도면 아님) — 볼트 2개로 체결하는 세로형(롱 타입) 오일 게이지의 일반적인 구성</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 380 230\" width=\"360\" height=\"218\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <rect x=\"70\" y=\"14\" width=\"44\" height=\"184\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <rect x=\"81\" y=\"44\" width=\"22\" height=\"124\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e3eef8\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <line x1=\"81\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"103\" y2=\"106\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"28\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"184\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <text x=\"92\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">정면</text> <rect x=\"200\" y=\"14\" width=\"24\" height=\"184\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <rect x=\"224\" y=\"22\" width=\"34\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#eeeeee\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <rect x=\"224\" y=\"178\" width=\"34\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#eeeeee\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <g stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"232\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"229\" y2=\"34\"><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"237\" y2=\"34\"><line x1=\"248\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"245\" y2=\"34\"><line x1=\"256\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"253\" y2=\"34\"> <line x1=\"232\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"229\" y2=\"190\"><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"237\" y2=\"190\"><line x1=\"248\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"245\" y2=\"190\"><line x1=\"256\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"253\" y2=\"190\"> </g> <text x=\"212\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">측면</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"103\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"70\"> <line x1=\"103\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"112\"> <line x1=\"258\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"282\" y2=\"50\"> <line x1=\"258\" y1=\"184\" x2=\"282\" y2=\"160\"> </g> <text x=\"134\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">투명 창</text> <text x=\"134\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">빨간 눈금</text> <text x=\"286\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">체결 볼트</text> <text x=\"286\" y=\"75\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">(E = 나사 규격)</text> <text x=\"286\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">체결 볼트</text> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">표의 E = 체결 나사 규격(표 하단 각주 기준)입니다. A~D는 본체 각부 치수이나, 원본 규격표에서 각 문자가 어느 부위를 재는지(볼트 피치·전장 등) 확인되지 않아 개념도에 표시하지 않았습니다 — 측정 위치가 필요하면 문의해 주세요. 창 뒷면에는 백색 반사판이 있으며, 비례는 실제와 다를 수 있습니다.</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">形状参考用の概念図（SWSカタログ実測図面・メーカー図面ではありません） — ボルト2本で締結する縦形（ロングタイプ）オイルゲージの一般的な構成</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 380 230\" width=\"360\" height=\"218\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <rect x=\"70\" y=\"14\" width=\"44\" height=\"184\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <rect x=\"81\" y=\"44\" width=\"22\" height=\"124\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e3eef8\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <line x1=\"81\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"103\" y2=\"106\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"28\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"184\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <text x=\"92\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">正面</text> <rect x=\"200\" y=\"14\" width=\"24\" height=\"184\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <rect x=\"224\" y=\"22\" width=\"34\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#eeeeee\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <rect x=\"224\" y=\"178\" width=\"34\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#eeeeee\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <g stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"232\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"229\" y2=\"34\"><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"237\" y2=\"34\"><line x1=\"248\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"245\" y2=\"34\"><line x1=\"256\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"253\" y2=\"34\"> <line x1=\"232\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"229\" y2=\"190\"><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"237\" y2=\"190\"><line x1=\"248\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"245\" y2=\"190\"><line x1=\"256\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"253\" y2=\"190\"> </g> <text x=\"212\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">側面</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"103\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"70\"> <line x1=\"103\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"112\"> <line x1=\"258\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"282\" y2=\"50\"> <line x1=\"258\" y1=\"184\" x2=\"282\" y2=\"160\"> </g> <text x=\"134\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">透明窓</text> <text x=\"134\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">赤い目盛</text> <text x=\"286\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">締結ボルト</text> <text x=\"286\" y=\"75\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">(E = ねじ規格)</text> <text x=\"286\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">締結ボルト</text> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">表のE = 締結ねじ規格（表下部の注記基準）です。A~Dは本体各部の寸法ですが、原本規格表で各文字がどの部位（ボルトピッチ・全長など）を測るか確認できなかったため概念図には表示していません — 測定位置が必要な場合はお問い合わせください。窓の裏面には白色反射板があり、比率は実際と異なる場合があります。</p>"},"zh":{"MHL형 오일 게이지 | [회사명] 베어링":"MHL型油位计 | [公司名] 轴承","<p class=\"eyebrow\">MHL Type Oil Gage</p> <h2>MHL형 오일 게이지</h2> <p>MHL형 오일게이지는 설치보드 셋트부분의 파손이나 강하수치를 사용하여 내충격에 강함으로 파손에 안심할 수 있으며, 빨간 눈금으로 낮고 오일량 부분의 뒷면이 백색의 반사판이 있어 오일량 확인은 웰른 오일의 세세한 변화까지 확인됩니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">MHL Type Oil Gage</p> <h2>MHL型油位计</h2> <p>MHL型油位计采用耐冲击结构,安装板连接部位不易损坏,因此可放心使用;红色刻度油量部分背面装有白色反射板,即使油量的细微变化也能清晰确认。</p>","단위: mm · A~D=본체 각부 치수 · E=체결 나사 규격":"单位: mm · A~D=主体各部尺寸 · E=紧固螺纹规格","<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">설치 방법</strong><br> 치수의 피치에 맞추어 E치수의 나사구멍을 열어 주십시오. 사용자를 위로하여 상하의 보드를 단단하게 평강으로 조여 주시면 견고하게 설치됩니다. 보통의 힘으로 설치하시고, 그 이상 단단하게 조일 필요는 없습니다.":"<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">安装方法</strong><br> 请按照尺寸的节距在E尺寸处开出螺纹孔。用扁钢将上下安装板牢固均匀地夹紧,即可稳固安装。请以正常力度安装,无需过度用力拧紧。","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">형태 참고용 개념도 (SWS 카탈로그 실측 도면·제조사 도면 아님) — 볼트 2개로 체결하는 세로형(롱 타입) 오일 게이지의 일반적인 구성</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 380 230\" width=\"360\" height=\"218\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <rect x=\"70\" y=\"14\" width=\"44\" height=\"184\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <rect x=\"81\" y=\"44\" width=\"22\" height=\"124\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e3eef8\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <line x1=\"81\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"103\" y2=\"106\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"28\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"184\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <text x=\"92\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">정면</text> <rect x=\"200\" y=\"14\" width=\"24\" height=\"184\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <rect x=\"224\" y=\"22\" width=\"34\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#eeeeee\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <rect x=\"224\" y=\"178\" width=\"34\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#eeeeee\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <g stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"232\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"229\" y2=\"34\"><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"237\" y2=\"34\"><line x1=\"248\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"245\" y2=\"34\"><line x1=\"256\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"253\" y2=\"34\"> <line x1=\"232\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"229\" y2=\"190\"><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"237\" y2=\"190\"><line x1=\"248\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"245\" y2=\"190\"><line x1=\"256\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"253\" y2=\"190\"> </g> <text x=\"212\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">측면</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"103\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"70\"> <line x1=\"103\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"112\"> <line x1=\"258\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"282\" y2=\"50\"> <line x1=\"258\" y1=\"184\" x2=\"282\" y2=\"160\"> </g> <text x=\"134\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">투명 창</text> <text x=\"134\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">빨간 눈금</text> <text x=\"286\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">체결 볼트</text> <text x=\"286\" y=\"75\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">(E = 나사 규격)</text> <text x=\"286\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">체결 볼트</text> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">표의 E = 체결 나사 규격(표 하단 각주 기준)입니다. A~D는 본체 각부 치수이나, 원본 규격표에서 각 문자가 어느 부위를 재는지(볼트 피치·전장 등) 확인되지 않아 개념도에 표시하지 않았습니다 — 측정 위치가 필요하면 문의해 주세요. 창 뒷면에는 백색 반사판이 있으며, 비례는 실제와 다를 수 있습니다.</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">仅供形状参考的示意图（非SWS样本实测图纸・制造商图纸） — 用2个螺栓紧固的竖式（长型）油位计的一般构成</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 380 230\" width=\"360\" height=\"218\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <rect x=\"70\" y=\"14\" width=\"44\" height=\"184\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <rect x=\"81\" y=\"44\" width=\"22\" height=\"124\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e3eef8\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <line x1=\"81\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"103\" y2=\"106\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"28\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"184\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <text x=\"92\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">正面</text> <rect x=\"200\" y=\"14\" width=\"24\" height=\"184\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <rect x=\"224\" y=\"22\" width=\"34\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#eeeeee\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <rect x=\"224\" y=\"178\" width=\"34\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#eeeeee\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"> <g stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"232\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"229\" y2=\"34\"><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"237\" y2=\"34\"><line x1=\"248\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"245\" y2=\"34\"><line x1=\"256\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"253\" y2=\"34\"> <line x1=\"232\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"229\" y2=\"190\"><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"237\" y2=\"190\"><line x1=\"248\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"245\" y2=\"190\"><line x1=\"256\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"253\" y2=\"190\"> </g> <text x=\"212\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">侧面</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"103\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"70\"> <line x1=\"103\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"112\"> <line x1=\"258\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"282\" y2=\"50\"> <line x1=\"258\" y1=\"184\" x2=\"282\" y2=\"160\"> </g> <text x=\"134\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">透明窗</text> <text x=\"134\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">红色刻度</text> <text x=\"286\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">紧固螺栓</text> <text x=\"286\" y=\"75\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">(E = 螺纹规格)</text> <text x=\"286\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">紧固螺栓</text> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">表中E = 紧固螺纹规格（以表下方注释为准）。A~D为本体各部位尺寸，但原始规格表中未能确认各字母所测部位（螺栓间距・全长等），因此未在示意图中标注 — 如需测量位置请咨询。窗口背面有白色反光板，比例可能与实物不同。</p>"}},"attrs":{"en":{},"ja":{},"zh":{}}}